commit 7dfe2dc13f889a8736d46c07a89521e8f86c669d
Author: Chris Rapier <rapier@psc.edu>
Date:   Mon Jun 22 21:12:58 2026 -0400

    Park whole-file verifies in a lightweight struct, not a range tracker struct
    
      The post-transfer verify phase parked a full sftp_range_tracker per
      whole-file (small / non-range-split) file - a pthread_mutex_t, writer-cap
      and vslots state, grant counters - just to carry three fields. Replace it
