    HPN verify: bundle integrity via server batch read-back
    
      Bundled small files were transferred unverified under HPNVerifyTransfer
      (default-on bundling, verify_transfer never consulted on the bundle path).
      Close that gap.
    
      Client tees a per-file source hash while packing (the tar data tap) and
