    HPN verify: cover range-split files (were silently unverified)
    
      A -jN HPNVerifyTransfer transfer of a file large enough to range-split
      skipped the post-transfer verify entirely: cfg.verify_transfer is not
      consulted in the split decision, and range units never reach
      execute_unit's whole-file verify. The file transferred unverified.
    
      Tag the range tracker with verify + the source path; the last range to
      finalize now runs the whole-file verify on its own live conn and records
      any mismatch in verify_failed_paths (exit 57).
    
