    Count unit dispatch as watchdog progress
    
      Byte counters freeze while the fleet idles at the prompt, so the first
      unit of the next command inherited the whole idle gap as silence and
      the endgame reaper fired at 0% of consecutive transfers on a warm
      fleet. Silence now runs from the most recent of byte progress, held
