commit 03c8893256b40378b89f63a538396277004a7a00
Author: Chris Rapier <rapier@psc.edu>
Date:   Thu Jun 11 17:36:05 2026 -0400

    Serialize progress-meter and log output; paint the final 100% update
    
      Meter redraws and stderr log writes raced on the terminal: log lines
      appended at the meter's end-of-line ("ETAworker connection wedged") or
      lost characters to interleaved writes. progressmeter registers a guard
      pair with log.c that clears the meter line before each log write under
      a shared mutex; the meter repaints on its next tick. Also snapshot the
