    sftp_fs_info_fuzz.cc  exercises the client-side reply parser for
    hpn-fs-info@hpnssh.org (sshbuf cstring + u64 + u32 + u64).
    
    Seed corpus is generated at build time by checked-in C programs
    (matches the mkcorpus_sntrup761 pattern in this dir):
    
    mkcorpus_sftp_bundle_extract.c  writes 6 ustar tarballs covering
    normal / multi-entry / deep-path / utf-8 / traversal-attempt /
    absolute-path cases.
    
    mkcorpus_sftp_fs_info.c  writes 5 wire blobs (lustre / ext4 / gpfs
    / empty / max-length fs_type) with hand-rolled big-endian SSH
    wire encoding (no sshbuf dep at build time).

