    sftp-parallel: promote MAX_RETRIES to HPNMaxRetries ssh_config option
    
      HPN_MAX_RETRIES is not a config option with a default of 3.
      Range limited to between 1 and 20, inclusive.
    
      Plumbing mirrors the HPNUseBundle pattern:
        - readconf.{c,h}: oHPNMaxRetries opcode, "hpnmaxretries" keyword,
          parse_int with fill-default of 3 and explicit clamp + stderr
          warning, dump_cfg_int for `-G` output.
        - sftp-parallel.h: max_retries field on struct sftp_parallel_config.
        - sftp-parallel-config.c: copies options.hpn_max_retries into
          pcfg->max_retries during the two-pass ssh_config read.
        - sftp-parallel.c: hpn_max_retries(p) reads env var first
          (HPN_MAX_RETRIES dev override, same clamp), then p->cfg
          .max_retries, then default 3.  The two retry-budget call sites
          in worker_process_result / worker_finalize_one_entry pass p.
    
