         completer with any_failed=1 unlinks the corrupt pre-allocated
         local file so the user cannot mistake it for a clean transfer.
         Upload-range counterpart is a documented follow-up.
    
      Verified via local sshd loopback: happy paths intact, cap-exceeded
      bundles fall back per-file, partial-range failure would unlink.

