    Maximum number of workers limited to 24.
    
    This is an arbitrary value mostly to prevent someone
    from accidentally fireing off 100 via a fat finger and DOSing
    themselves. It's worth noting that this isn's a security
    measure as there's no good way to prevent someone from
    DOSing a server if they just want to run a bash loop to
    fire up a thousand hpnsftp sessions. It's up to the server
    to prevent that.

