commit 117bb09172696dd65bd68d4de5b1016fb019b94d
Author: Chris Rapier <rapier@psc.edu>
Date:   Sun May 3 15:11:57 2026 -0400

     sftp-controlmaster: add ControlMaster lifecycle helper
    
      New module providing spawn / auth-wait / teardown for an "hpnssh -M -N"
      sentinel process. The parallel-streams orchestrator uses this to amortize
      authentication across worker connections (Pattern B: workers open their
      own TCP connections, but reuse agent/credential state seeded by the
      master).
    
      Socket is created under a per-process mode-0700 mkdtemp directory to
      prevent observation or tampering by other local users. BatchMode=yes
      forces fast-fail on auth that needs interaction, dovetailing with the
      parallel-mode requirement that pubkey or agent auth be available.

