commit 6e252953b4ce7bc521b2ecc31aa4aae1f3428f22
Author: Chris Rapier <rapier@psc.edu>
Date:   Thu Apr 23 17:58:45 2026 -0400

    Insert sshbuf_reset before builing new buffer.
    
    Turns out that the old method didbn't fully clear the buffer
    and left some residual bytes on the buffer. Thsi is because
    functions liek get_status didn't read all the bytes leaving the
    pointer in the wrong place. This didn't show up before because
    the buffer was torn down each time. Since we don't do that anymore
    we need to ensure that the buffer is clear before we start over.

commit 76444c8e5771be7544a206ab1af569b1bd758506
