    Reduce the number of allocs and frees in sftp client.
    
    add a msg buf eleemnt to sftp-conn struct. We reuse this instead
    of allocating a new buffer, using it, and then freeing it in
    every operation. This avoids a lot of mallocs and frees during bulk
    data transfers. Thsi patch is invasive but pretty straighforward.

