commit 0c5d1835182a434a0afd942993274efb27c7cd98
Author: Chris Rapier <rapier@psc.edu>
Date:   Tue Apr 7 16:30:55 2026 -0400

    in the aes-ctr function might deref NULL.
    
    In stop_and_join_pregen_threads() we use HASH_FIND_INT to determine
    which EVP_CIPHER_CTX to free. If it can't find the pointer it returns
    NULL and we end up dereferencing NULL. This fixes that by testing for NULL
    and fatal if it is NULL. This is very unlikely to happen.

